11. Net Loss Per Share

The Company's Series A Preferred Stock is considered a participating security because it entitles holders to participate in dividends to common stockholders, on an as-converted basis. The participating securities do not have a contractual obligation to share in the losses of the Company. Therefore, net loss is fully attributable to the Company's common stockholders for the three and six months ended June 30, 2026 and 2025.

